      "text": "YOU CAN'T BREAK ANYTHING\n\nUntil you say \"it's ready\",\nnothing you do changes what\nanyone else sees. Walk away\nmid-way and nothing happens.",
      "originalText": "YOU CAN'T BREAK ANYTHING\n\nUntil you say \"it's ready\",\nnothing you do changes what\nanyone else sees. Walk away\nmid-way and nothing happens.",
