      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THREE WORDS YOU'LL SEE\n\ncommit  \u2014  save a version,\nwith a note on what changed\n\npush  \u2014  put it somewhere\nothers can open it\n\nmerge  \u2014  make it the\nofficial one",
      "originalText": "THREE WORDS YOU'LL SEE\n\ncommit  \u2014  save a version,\nwith a note on what changed\n\npush  \u2014  put it somewhere\nothers can open it\n\nmerge  \u2014  make it the\nofficial one",
